step Orgrimmar
  only Hunter,Shaman
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip The Undercity has no Hunter or Shaman trainer: take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the same tower instead and train in the city, then take the Undercity zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar's main gate.
  train class

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff; Turak Runetotem trains you on Elder Rise. Then fly to Orgrimmar and take the Undercity zeppelin from the tower outside the main gate.
  train class

step Undercity trainers
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Undercity
  tip Train while you are in the Undercity: the trainers stand in the War Quarter, the Rogues' Quarter and the Magic Quarter (Paladins: Garen Largo).
  train class

