  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip West of the cove the Daggerspine Raiders and Sorceresses (38-40) hold the shore: pull them one at a time. The two wrecks lie in the shallows off it, the charts and logs inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around the wrecks.
  kill 2595 quest 664.1               -- Underwater
