step Circle of West Binding: kill these as you meet them
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The western circle is near Thoradin's Wall, where you came in.
  tip The Syndicate hold the walled manor and its farm in the north-west; their Highwaymen, Mercenaries and Pathstalkers carry the Bloodstone Amulets.
  tip Careful: Highwaymen (level 30-31) can be in Sneak, so they may be hidden when you approach.
  collect 4495 quest 671
  collect 4483 quest 651              -- Burning Key

