# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Into the Badlands

step Into the Badlands
  zone Badlands
  tip Head south-west out of Arathi over Thandol Span, south through the Wetlands (keep clear of Menethil Harbor) and east into Loch Modan; the road leaves Loch Modan to the south into the Badlands. Follow it south to the goblin camp in the Valley of Fangs.
  goto 42.3,52.8 "Valley of Fangs"

