step The Dustbowl: kill these as you meet them
  zone Badlands
  tip Every rock elemental in the Badlands drops Jarkal's shards: the Lesser Rock Elementals (37) on the flats west of Lotwil's camp are the safe ones, about one kill in five. Only the Greater Rock Elementals (42-44, well above you) in the south-western gulches drop Lotwil's bracers, also about one kill in five: pull one at a time and rest between fights, or leave them. Keep killing coyotes and buzzards you still need on the way.
